---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | China Attractions in Beijing" description="Privacy policy for China Attractions in Beijing: what data we collect through Google Analytics and email, how it is used, and the choices available to you.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-12 pb-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-base-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-base-500 mb-8">Last updated: September 4, 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">The short version</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">We collect anonymous, aggregated usage statistics (via Google Analytics) to learn which guides are useful. We do not sell data, do not run ads, and do not ask you to create an account. If you email us, we use your address only to reply.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">Analytics</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">This site uses Google Analytics (Google Ireland Limited) to measure page views, referring sources, and general usage patterns. Data collected includes:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      <li>Pages visited and time on page</li>
      <li>Approximate location (country/city level), browser type, and device category</li>
      <li>The referral source that brought you to the site</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser to distinguish visits. You can block these cookies in your browser settings or via <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-accent hover:underline" rel="noopener">Google's opt-out browser add-on</a> without losing any site functionality &mdash; every guide on this site works fully without analytics.</p>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Google's handling of this data is governed by <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-accent hover:underline" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>. We never combine analytics data with personally identifiable information, because we do not collect any.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">Email contact</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">If you write to <a href="mailto:hello@china-attractions-in-beijing.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@china-attractions-in-beijing.com</a> with corrections or questions, we store your message and address for as long as needed to handle your feedback, and never add you to a mailing list or share your address.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">What we never do</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      <li>Sell, rent, or trade any data</li>
      <li>Run advertising or third-party ad tracking</li>
      <li>Require sign-ups, logins, or payment information</li>
      <li>Collect personal data through the site itself</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">External links</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">We link to official attraction websites, UNESCO listings, and other independent resources. Those sites have their own privacy practices, which we encourage you to review.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">If our data practices change, we will update this page and revise the date above.</p>

    <p class="text-sm text-base-500 mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-base-200">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@china-attractions-in-beijing.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@china-attractions-in-beijing.com</a> or see our <a href="/about/" class="text-accent hover:underline">About page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
